.TH HTTP_METHOD 3
.SH NAME
http_method \- name of a request method
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include <http.h>
.P
.BI "const char* http_method(http_req_t " type ");"
.SH DESCRIPTION
.BR http_method ()
returns the method as it is written in the request line: "GET", "POST", "PUT", "DELETE",
"PATCH" or "HEAD". An unknown value gives "GET".
.SH SEE ALSO
http_open(3)
